  "instructions": [
    "1. In a large pan over medium-high heat, cook the ground beef until browned, breaking it up into small pieces as it cooks.",
    "2. Add the diced onion to the pan and cook until translucent.",
    "3. Add the spicy taco seasoning to the pan and stir to combine.",
    "4. Reduce heat to medium-low and simmer the mixture for 5-7 minutes.",
    "5. Warm the tortillas by wrapping them in a damp paper towel and microwaving for 20-30 seconds.",
    "6. Assemble the tacos by spooning the beef mixture onto a tortilla and topping with cheese, a squeeze of lime juice, and any desired toppings.",
    "7. Serve immediately and enjoy!"
